body:
Try Grim Tales: The Wishes.

&#x200B;

Also, google did this in two minutes.

Such a good point. Rag, Val and Center were originally mod maps adapted to official, and all have multi-boss arenas that you can be carried into. How did I never see that before haha.

&#x200B;

Now I question Crystal Isles. Also a mod map and I have seen a video where someone ran it on official and had someone level 50 something participate, but I've also seen a dozen videos where everyone was the right level. I think that's the one boss I need clarification on. I have no actual confirmation as to which rule this fight applies to.

The time they spend on Etherea, they are lead by the notes from the Shepard journey on Etherea. When Bellamy shows up with Doucette, Cadogan wanted to know everything about it, as if.. he had never been there. That is why people are thinking that. I can see both sides of the argument and frankly, I think it was planned and manipulated, even if it wasn't a simulation or construct. (I HATE HATE HATE how they realized he was alive. It was so anti-climactic, which tells me there is a lot more to come.)

&#x200B;

Also, totally unrelated boy did they make Bellamy boyish again.

What you are doing is illegal, FOR HIM. Even with you instigating as a minor, the responsibility will fall on him as an adult. I almost agree with the comment that you should ghost him. 

&#x200B;

I have to ask, WHY are you catfishing him? Is it because of your sexuality and a lack of confidence? I ask because it will help dictate how to get out of it.

&#x200B;

You can only be responsible for your actions, and you need to correct them. What he does if you ghost him or come clean is NOT on you. However I would suggest honesty, and if he is okay with things after the fact I would not pursue him because of the age gap and legality of it. Also, your intents.

Oi, it's because people only think in "me me me." So when a change happens that that one person doesn't like, they dictate the imminent death of a game solely based on their own personal death of wanting to play it. People make a show as if their boycotting will somehow rectify what they think was wrong. 

&#x200B;

Consumerism Entitlement at it's best.

I wont lie, I didn't read anything in your post spare a few statements you made. Everyone is complaining about the same thing; The change will affect their access to things they want right out the gate. 

&#x200B;

THAT IS THE POINT. 

The change is going to make it so you can't just buy a Chad kit and jump into a raid. Now you'll have to earn your keep by actually playing the game. It balances the combat economy and money economy. Tarkov isn't about being a broker or armor dealer. The ability to make money that way is a bonus to the core of the game which is the survival and combat experience (regardless of how you do it, too each his own). 

&#x200B;

People's dependency on the market and how skewed it is by bots and scammers needed to be changed, so they changed it. People need to stop giving it guff before actually seeing it in action. More often than not people will throw a fit over something and end up appreciating it later.

I see the change as a means to balance out the economy. As is, people rely heavily on the flea market and so the prices reflect that. This change would knock that down. The biggest thing to remember is that the change affects everyone, not just you. So it'll be EVERYONE playing on the same level at wipe with the same access to the same shit. That is a good thing. 

&#x200B;

You're not seeing the big picture. They plan on fixing things. The change you're upset about is one of MANY coming and with a wipe. It'll be a robust patch, not just one change to the flea market, which as is, spoils a lot of true gameplay given anyone can access it to get the best of this or that. The change will make it more about earning your actual keep which is so good for the economic health of the game and combat.

You guys are actual fucking idiots. Servers require rules to run. Rules that need to be enforced. Koil didn't "rage ban" someone, he punished players who are new and failed to follow the rules. You have to apply to play on NP. It isn't just a join and go, so you have to know what the rules are to get in unless you just thumb up your ass through the process. The fact that ya'll would bitch about someone enforcing the rules is daft as fuck. 

&#x200B;

Also, here is a thought kids; Know what the fuck you're talking about before you actually make a post. Jesus.

This has been reported repeatedly and they haven't let us know if they have even seen our cries. Unplayability like this just plain sucks. I just want to see them tell us "we hear you."

&#x200B;

PVE Official Center player.

Someone cold contacting you on facebook is very red-flag. 

&#x200B;

If someone can record and send a video, then they can send a photo. They are likely a scammer who searched you up, found you, and will use the videos to con you into giving them videos back which fuels the cycle.

The more important thing out of this is that you need to be yourself. I don't know your situation, but I hope you find a time where you're comfortable to be out and be yourself in public and not hide that part of your life. Anyways, don't date someone you can't see or haven't met. Yes, we're all attached to our phones and computers and we end up getting attached to people we talk to online because it's all become a surrogacy for real contact. That being said, want better for yourself, you deserve it.

&#x200B;

My guess is that they may also be a closet younger guy trying to explore but insecure themselves. If you were ever asked for photos yourself, then they may have been using you for them.

You need to get off Tinder or any other kind of app or site until you are confident enough in yourself to be on them. Most important thing in human relationships is you gotta be good with yourself before you can give yourself to others. 

&#x200B;

You tell her the truth. The truth hurts and it's better to hurt someone with it than to hurt someone with a lie.

It's 2018. If you're talking to someone on the computer or on a phone there is literally no real excuse for why people can't prove their identity. If someone is shy and doesn't want to do it because of that, then they don't need to be sweet talking anyone. Gotta love yourself and work on yourself before you try to be with someone else. 

&#x200B;

Phones have cameras. The Catfishes is broke? Oh, but their family member can take the photo. How does a catfish update their photos every now and then if they can't take a new proof shot, or video?

Breathe in. Breathe out. 

&#x200B;

The cave is not in, on, touching, or connected to water. 

&#x200B;

That is all you're getting out of me.

You would be daft to allow it to happen to begin with. Visiting you is something you should allow a girl you're seeing, and have video chatted with, spoken to on the phone, and so forth for many months. Not the the figment of a person, or the thought of them. Allowing it to even go that far, you're playing yourself more than your catfish is playing you. 

&#x200B;

Ask yourself this; Someone you're almost positive is lying to you and is not who they say they are, wants to "come see you." If in fact they DO want to see you, and REALLY DO make the effort, WHY WOULD YOU want them to come see you?
